TI  - Data Access Control Method of Power Terminal Based on Trust and Reputation
T2  - 2022 6TH INTERNATIONAL SYMPOSIUM ON COMPUTER SCIENCE AND INTELLIGENT CONTROL, ISCSIC
CP  - 6th International Symposium on Computer Science and Intelligent Control (ISCSIC)
KW  - cloud computing
KW  - trust level
KW  - user reputation
KW  - power terminal data
KW  - access control
AB  - Aiming at the problems of poor data confidentiality, complex communication overhead and large amount of computation in traditional power terminal data access control, a data access control method of power terminal based on trust and reputation was proposed. Firstly, a flexible data access control system of power terminal was designed based on cloud computing technology, and key generation, key segmentation, proxy re-encryption and decryption were adopted to obtain the trust level and user reputation of the end users. Then, the data access of power terminal was controlled. Finally, the security analysis and performance analysis of the user's trust and reputation evaluation results were carried out through the encryption system. Experimental results showed that the proposed method can effectively reduce the communication overhead and computational complexity of data access, improve data confidentiality, and reduce the application cost of power terminal equipment, and has stability and effectiveness.
