TI  - Attribute-Based Access Control With Credible Outsourcing and Collusion-Resistant Revocation Based on Blockchain for Iomt
T2  - CONCURRENCY AND COMPUTATION-PRACTICE & EXPERIENCE
KW  - attribute revocation
KW  - CP-ABE
KW  - data sharing
KW  - IoMT
