AB  - In order to solve the problems of account integration and authentication authorization among multiple business applications in power system, this paper studies the common authentication technology and business scenarios of unified authority management, and puts forward a design scheme of unified authority management platform combined with the design concept of microservice architecture, which meets the needs of multi type business system access of transmission network, and realizes the functions of authentication, authentication, user management, access control and so on. At present, the unified authority management platform based on this design scheme has passed the system security detection of Electric Power Research Institute, and has been applied online in Qinghai Electric Power Research Institute, and achieved good results.
