TI  - A Trust-based Access Control Scheme for e-Health Cloud
T2  - 2018 IEEE/ACS 15TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON COMPUTER SYSTEMS AND APPLICATIONS (AICCSA)
CP  - 15th IEEE/ACS International Conference on Computer Systems and Applications (AICCSA)
