TI  - Secure Token-Key Implications in an Enterprise Multi-Tenancy Environment Using BGV-EHC Hybrid Homomorphic Encryption
T2  - ELECTRONICS
KW  - Session Initiation Time (SIT)
KW  - Type of Tenant (TTenant)
KW  - Type of Data (TData)
