AB  - Storage provided by cloud is the valuable and significant utilization of cloud services for cloud users. Cloud systems are useful for data sharing among the group and give a large number of benefits to users. Major characteristics of cloud computing includes integrity, confidentiality, privacy and accountability. It allows sharing of files between different users using cloud computing based technologies. In this paper, we have categorized various cryptographic schemes for secure data sharing in cloud with their merits and demerits.
