TI  - A new agent-based framework combining authentication, access control and user behavior analysis for secure and flexible cloud-based healthcare environment
T2  - CONCURRENCY AND COMPUTATION-PRACTICE & EXPERIENCE
KW  - access control
KW  - authentication
KW  - cloud computing
KW  - ECC
KW  - healthcare
