TI  - FABRIC: Fast and Secure Unbounded Cross-System Encrypted Data Sharing in Cloud Computing
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON DEPENDABLE AND SECURE COMPUTING
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Fabrics
KW  - Public key
KW  - Encryption
