TI  - Efficient Key-Aggregate Proxy Re-Encryption for Secure Data Sharing in Clouds
T2  - 2018 IEEE CONFERENCE ON DEPENDABLE AND SECURE COMPUTING (DSC)
CP  - IEEE Conference on Dependable and Secure Computing (DSC)
