TI  - Revocable Attribute-Based Encryption With Data Integrity in Clouds
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON DEPENDABLE AND SECURE COMPUTING
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Cryptography
KW  - Data integrity
