TI  - A Privacy-Preserving and Untraceable Group Data Sharing Scheme in Cloud Computing
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON DEPENDABLE AND SECURE COMPUTING
KW  - Servers
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Security
