TI  - Privacy-by-Design and Minimization within a Small Electronic Health Record: The Health360 Case Study
T2  - APPLIED SCIENCES-BASEL
KW  - access
KW  - data protection
KW  - electronic health record
KW  - GDPR
KW  - healthcare
KW  - minimization
KW  - privacy
