TI  - A Novel Revocable and Identity-Based Conditional Proxy Re-Encryption Scheme With Ciphertext Evolution for Secure Cloud Data Sharing
T2  - IEEE ACCESS
KW  - Authorization
KW  - Security
KW  - Cryptography
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Resists
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Identity-based encryption
