AB  - The developed software is a web application with open access and is aimed on forecasting of time series stored in database. We proposed approach of time series forecasting, combined ARIMA models with fuzzy techniques: three fuzzy time series models, fuzzy transformation (F-transform) and ACL-scale. Applications of a proposed web service have demonstrated efficiency in practical time series predictions with suitable accuracy.
