TI  - Green corrosion inhibitor for oilfield application II: The time-evolution effect on the sweet corrosion of API X60 steel in synthetic brine and the inhibition performance of 2-(2-pyridyl) benzimidazole under turbulent hydrodynamics
T2  - CORROSION SCIENCE
KW  - API X60 steel
KW  - Electrochemistry
KW  - Benzimidazole
