TI  - Secured two factor authentication, graph based replication and encryption strategy in cloud computing
T2  - MULTIMEDIA TOOLS AND APPLICATIONS
KW  - Graph-based encryption
KW  - Replication
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Packing coloring
KW  - Jump graph
KW  - Web graph
