TI  - A multi-authority security system based on the cloud and Radio frequency identification systems
T2  - 2025 7TH INTERNATIONAL CONGRESS ON HUMAN-COMPUTER INTERACTION, OPTIMIZATION AND ROBOTIC APPLICATIONS, ICHORA
CP  - 7th International Congress on Human-Computer Interaction, Optimization and Robotic Applications-ICHORA
