TI  - A Mobile Cloud-based Access Control with Efficiently Outsourced Decryption
T2  - 2022 10TH IEEE INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON MOBILE CLOUD COMPUTING, SERVICES, AND ENGINEERING, MOBILECLOUD
