TI  - A policy-oriented secured service for the e-commerce applications in cloud
T2  - PERSONAL AND UBIQUITOUS COMPUTING
KW  - Information technology
KW  - E-commerce
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Policy-oriented service
KW  - Trust and security policy
