TI  - Efficient CP-ABE Scheme With Shared Decryption in Cloud Storage
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON COMPUTERS
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Servers
KW  - Security
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Logic gates
KW  - Access control
KW  - Generators
KW  - Cloud storage
