TI  - RETRACTION: RETRACTED: Design and implementation of intelligent manufacturing system based on sensor networks and cloud computing technology (Retracted Article)
T2  - OPTICAL AND QUANTUM ELECTRONICS
KW  - Sensor network
KW  - Cloud computing technology
KW  - Intelligent manufacturing system
KW  - Data transmission
AB  - Intelligent manufacturing, as the fundamental industrial sector of the national economy, is one of the more important factors determining the level of national development, and its importance is self-evident. The maturity of IoT technology has provided new opportunities for China's manufacturing industry, and has also made intelligent manufacturing a future research direction for development. Therefore, this article proposes a layered routing protocol based on sensor networks, conducts in-depth research on the LEACH algorithm, and calculates the energy consumption required during data transmission. In response to the phenomenon of energy waste caused by uneven distribution of data nodes, relevant solutions have been adopted, and the ABE algorithm has been widely applied in cloud computing technology. At the same time, a brief overview of the KP-ABE algorithm has been provided. Utilize a reliable authorization mechanism to store the master key MSK and public key PK to ensure data security. The final experimental results indicate that the intelligent manufacturing system proposed in this article based on sensor networks and cloud computing technology has successfully solved the problems faced by traditional manufacturing industries in production planning management, production manufacturing management, and quality management. Therefore, the intelligent manufacturing system proposed in this article has great benefits for improving the production and management capabilities of enterprises.
