TI  - A Privacy-Preserving IoT Data Access Control Scheme for Cloud-Edge Computing
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON PARALLEL AND DISTRIBUTED SYSTEMS
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Servers
