TI  - ACKS-IA: An Access Control and Key Agreement Scheme for Securing Industry 4.0 Applications
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON NETWORK SCIENCE AND ENGINEERING
KW  - Access control
KW  - Security
KW  - Fourth Industrial Revolution
KW  - Cloud computing
