TI  - Wireless Biometric Attendance Management System Using Raspberry Pi in IaaS Environment
T2  - INTERNATIONAL PROCEEDINGS ON ADVANCES IN SOFT COMPUTING, INTELLIGENT SYSTEMS AND APPLICATIONS, ASISA 2016
CP  - International Conference on Advances in Soft Computing, Intelligent Systems and Applications (ASISA)
