TI  - Efficient Identity-Based Public Integrity Auditing of Shared Data in Cloud Storage With User Privacy Preserving
T2  - IEEE ACCESS
KW  - Data privacy
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Protocols
KW  - Data integrity
KW  - Cryptography
KW  - Servers
KW  - Privacy
