TI  - An Innovative Prefabricated Microsystem for Industrial IoT: Addressing Remote Onboarding and OS Provisioning Challenges for Edge Nodes
T2  - IEEE ACCESS
KW  - Security
KW  - Industrial Internet of Things
KW  - Protocols
KW  - Authentication
KW  - Servers
KW  - Cloud computing
