TI  - An Efficient Verifiable Searchable Encryption Scheme With Aggregating Authorization for Blockchain-Enabled IoT
T2  - IEEE INTERNET OF THINGS JOURNAL
KW  - Internet of Things
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Cryptography
KW  - Blockchains
