TI  - An Attribute-based Searchable Encryption Scheme Supporting Trapdoor Updating
T2  - 2018 16TH IEEE INT CONF ON DEPENDABLE, AUTONOM AND SECURE COMP, 16TH IEEE INT CONF ON PERVAS INTELLIGENCE AND COMP, 4TH IEEE INT CONF ON BIG DATA INTELLIGENCE AND COMP, 3RD IEEE CYBER SCI AND TECHNOL CONGRESS (DASC/PICOM/DATACOM/CYBERSCITECH)
