TI  - Identity-Based Cloud Storage Auditing for Data Sharing With Access Control of Sensitive Information
T2  - IEEE INTERNET OF THINGS JOURNAL
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Protocols
KW  - Data integrity
KW  - Servers
KW  - Privacy
KW  - Medical services
