TI  - A Scalable and Distributed Hierarchical Architecture for Network Monitoring-on-Demand
T2  - 2024 3RD INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON 6G NETWORKING, 6GNET
CP  - 3rd International Conference on 6G Networking
