TI  - A revocable multi-authority attribute-based encryption scheme for fog-enabled IoT
T2  - JOURNAL OF SYSTEMS ARCHITECTURE
KW  - Ciphertext-policy attribute-based encryption (CP-ABE)
KW  - User revocation
