TI  - Expressive Access Control Encryption With Bilateral Policy Privacy for Consumer Electronics in the Metaverse
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON CONSUMER ELECTRONICS
KW  - Metaverse
KW  - Access control
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Consumer electronics
KW  - Privacy
KW  - Receivers
