T2  - 2022 9TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON INTERNET OF THINGS: SYSTEMS, MANAGEMENT AND SECURITY, IOTSMS
CP  - 9th IEEE International Conference on Internet of Things - Systems, Management and Security (IOTSMS)
