TI  - Oblivious Keyword Search With Authorization and Verification for IoT Devices in Untrusted Cloud Environments
T2  - IEEE INTERNET OF THINGS JOURNAL
KW  - Servers
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Receivers
KW  - Cryptography
KW  - Internet of Things
