TI  - A Robust Generic Multi-Authority Attributes Management System for Cloud Storage Services
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON CLOUD COMPUTING
KW  - Attribute based encryption
KW  - proxy re-encryption
KW  - public key infrastructure
KW  - cloud computing
KW  - digital
KW  - DATA ACCESS-CONTROL
KW  - ENCRYPTION
KW  - EFFICIENT
