TI  - There's a Hole in that Bucket! A Large-scale Analysis of Misconfigured S3 Buckets
T2  - 34TH ANNUAL COMPUTER SECURITY APPLICATIONS CONFERENCE (ACSAC 2018)
CP  - 34th Annual Computer Security Applications Conference (ACSAC)
