TI  - Towards Smart Blockchain-Based System for Privacy and Security in a Smart City environment
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF 2020 5TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON CLOUD COMPUTING AND ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE: TECHNOLOGIES AND APPLICATIONS (CLOUDTECH'20)
CP  - 5th International Conference on Cloud Computing and Artificial Intelligence - Technologies and Applications (CloudTech)
