TI  - Proxy re-encryption with plaintext checkable encryption for integrating digital twins into IIoT
T2  - COMPUTERS & ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING
KW  - Digital twin
KW  - Signcryption
KW  - Plaintext Checkable Encryption (PCE)
